      "parameters": {
        "width": 760,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "## GHL v2 - Setup Sheets (run once)\nCreates the tabs `Leads_v2` and `Rejected` if they are missing (existing tabs are skipped) and writes their header rows.\n\nSet the Google credential on the 3 Sheets nodes, replace `__SHEET_ID__`, then click **Execute workflow**.\nAfterwards format column `phone` (H) in `Leads_v2` and F in `Rejected` as Plain text."
      }
    }
